Subject: [PATCH 032/371] black pearl: the treasure map is given, its button
 starts the fight, and stages one and two can end

- The c3.6 TreasureMapReward called a trade method that never existed, so no Black Pearl map was ever given.
  LocalTrade gains giveNewTreasureMap; maps live under the inventory (not in the database) while the owner is on,
  stale map ids are dropped at login, and a pirate on the boss quest gets the map again at every login.
- The map's requestStart read a missing TM_GAME_STYLES; it now joins a fight still at its start or builds one.
- Killing the last Navy guard never checked stage one; it does now (the ship capture is still needed).
- Nothing reported a sunk attack ship, so stage two never ended; a 2 s check counts each ship sunk or gone once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
